        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Container Terminal Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage your own rail container terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small terminal yard and gradually transform it into a modern logistics hub capable of handling large freight trains, thousands of containers, and a growing fleet of specialized equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to receive container trains, organize unloading operations, manage storage yards, expand infrastructure, and make strategic decisions that determine the efficiency and profitability of your terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/a4e9fb7251a345851a4443b00dec3012.avif?t=1783073166\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras_big/a4e9fb7251a345851a4443b00dec3012.webp?t=1783073166 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operate Specialized Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every operation within the terminal relies on dedicated container handling machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Forklifts<br>• Top container handlers<br>• Side container handlers<br>• Container trucks and trailers<br>• Automated gantry cranes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vehicle serves a specific purpose and allows you to perform different tasks across the terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/d53c0025ecb55848b7631d6e7d8a1037.avif?t=1783073166\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras_big/d53c0025ecb55848b7631d6e7d8a1037.webp?t=1783073166 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handle Container Trains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive freight trains and manage incoming container traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unload railcars manually or use automated equipment to increase terminal productivity and streamline operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your terminal grows, new logistics challenges and train types will become available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0ce55f282d8967ee71ee4f660cdfed09.poster.avif?t=1783073166\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0ce55f282d8967ee71ee4f660cdfed09.webm?t=1783073166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0ce55f282d8967ee71ee4f660cdfed09.mp4?t=1783073166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Double-Stack Trains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your terminal reaches higher development levels, you will gain access to double-stack container trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These trains carry significantly more cargo and require efficient yard management, advanced equipment, and careful planning to handle successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/4192854c27e2e6489fa698fee2e287ad.avif?t=1783073166\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras_big/4192854c27e2e6489fa698fee2e287ad.webp?t=1783073166 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Efficient Container Yards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and organize your storage areas the way you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own container layouts, optimize available space, and use different types of equipment to handle stacked containers efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher stacking capacity increases terminal throughput but also requires more powerful machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/d497ad90a203f51f16556e08f0332830.avif?t=1783073166\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras_big/d497ad90a203f51f16556e08f0332830.webp?t=1783073166 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Terminal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money from cargo operations and reinvest profits into growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new equipment, unlock additional capabilities, and improve terminal efficiency through strategic development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade helps you process more cargo and build a more successful logistics operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0186cc74a133bfede396dbdb98f2dedb.avif?t=1783073166\" width=1348 height=535 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living Logistics Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The terminal features multiple logistics companies, each represented by unique container branding and markings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day and night cycles, diverse container types, and continuously arriving trains help create an active and immersive logistics environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/033b6b5dd666154e65c8c3bf5bad9db2.avif?t=1783073166\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras_big/033b6b5dd666154e65c8c3bf5bad9db2.webp?t=1783073166 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Operate multiple types of container handling equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Manage rail-based container logistics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Handle double-stack container trains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Use automated gantry cranes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Develop and expand your terminal business</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Purchase and unlock new equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Stack containers across large storage yards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Experience a variety of logistics companies and container brands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Dynamic day and night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Progressive terminal expansion system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Regular updates and ongoing development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you transform a small rail terminal into a thriving logistics hub and prove yourself as a true logistics tycoon? 🚂📦🚜</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Container Terminal Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage your own rail container terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small terminal yard and gradually transform it into a modern logistics hub capable of handling large freight trains, thousands of containers, and a growing fleet of specialized equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to receive container trains, organize unloading operations, manage storage yards, expand infrastructure, and make strategic decisions that determine the efficiency and profitability of your terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/a4e9fb7251a345851a4443b00dec3012.avif?t=1783073166\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras_big/a4e9fb7251a345851a4443b00dec3012.webp?t=1783073166 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operate Specialized Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every operation within the terminal relies on dedicated container handling machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Forklifts<br>• Top container handlers<br>• Side container handlers<br>• Container trucks and trailers<br>• Automated gantry cranes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vehicle serves a specific purpose and allows you to perform different tasks across the terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/d53c0025ecb55848b7631d6e7d8a1037.avif?t=1783073166\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras_big/d53c0025ecb55848b7631d6e7d8a1037.webp?t=1783073166 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handle Container Trains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive freight trains and manage incoming container traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unload railcars manually or use automated equipment to increase terminal productivity and streamline operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your terminal grows, new logistics challenges and train types will become available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0ce55f282d8967ee71ee4f660cdfed09.poster.avif?t=1783073166\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0ce55f282d8967ee71ee4f660cdfed09.webm?t=1783073166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0ce55f282d8967ee71ee4f660cdfed09.mp4?t=1783073166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Double-Stack Trains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your terminal reaches higher development levels, you will gain access to double-stack container trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These trains carry significantly more cargo and require efficient yard management, advanced equipment, and careful planning to handle successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/4192854c27e2e6489fa698fee2e287ad.avif?t=1783073166\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras_big/4192854c27e2e6489fa698fee2e287ad.webp?t=1783073166 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Efficient Container Yards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and organize your storage areas the way you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own container layouts, optimize available space, and use different types of equipment to handle stacked containers efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher stacking capacity increases terminal throughput but also requires more powerful machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/d497ad90a203f51f16556e08f0332830.avif?t=1783073166\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras_big/d497ad90a203f51f16556e08f0332830.webp?t=1783073166 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Terminal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money from cargo operations and reinvest profits into growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new equipment, unlock additional capabilities, and improve terminal efficiency through strategic development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade helps you process more cargo and build a more successful logistics operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0186cc74a133bfede396dbdb98f2dedb.avif?t=1783073166\" width=1348 height=535 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living Logistics Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The terminal features multiple logistics companies, each represented by unique container branding and markings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day and night cycles, diverse container types, and continuously arriving trains help create an active and immersive logistics environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/033b6b5dd666154e65c8c3bf5bad9db2.avif?t=1783073166\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras_big/033b6b5dd666154e65c8c3